<title>SWEDEN: Sweden approves Danish buy of Ostgota Bank.</title>
<headline>Sweden approves Danish buy of Ostgota Bank.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Finance Inspectorate said on Tuesday it had approved the purchase by Denmark's Den Danske Bank of Swedish bank Ostgota Enskilda Bank.  </p>
<p>The previously announced purchase is being made through the Danish bank's Swedish subsidiary DDB Invest AB.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
</text>
